Package: tabmBccnnR
Type: Project
Title: R + Keras 3 port of the TabM-bCCNN claims reserving ensembles
Version: 0.1.0
Description: The blended cross-classified network of Gabrielli (2020, Ch. 4 /
    Paper C) fitted as a TabM weight-sharing ensemble (Gorishniy et al. 2025),
    under a time-aware and the thesis's claim-level validation split, ported
    from the Python project "bCCNN embedding of the ccODP reserving model" to
    R with the keras3 package (1.5.1) on the torch backend. The code follows
    the style of Masters-Research-R. This file lists the packages used (and
    lets here::here() find the project root).
Imports:
    ChainLadder,
    config,
    data.table,
    ggplot2,
    here,
    jsonlite,
    keras3,
    reticulate,
    testthat
Encoding: UTF-8
